          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5997
        },
        {
          "text": "A kid lost a shoe in the pumpkin field. For reasons still unclear to me, I became involved in retrieving it",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6130
        },
        {
          "text": "Through all of it, my attention kept finding Carson",
          "ok": true,
