    },
    {
      "block": "原句12",
      "no": 12,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Our festival.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12058
        },
        {
          "text": "The correction came automatically, and something warm spread through my chest",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12072
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yeah.” I pointed toward her. “Still yours.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12186
        },
        {
          "text": "“We’ve already made more than I thought we’d make opening weekend.” There was disbelief in her voice",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12402
        },
        {
          "text": "Feed",
          "ok": true,
