        },
        {
          "text": "hadn’t had in years. I didn’t say any of it. I only smiled",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12697
        }
      ],
      "words": 62
    },
    {
      "block": "原句13",
      "no": 13,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I laughed. Then crossed the kitchen and kissed the top of her head. Carson caught my wrist before I could move away. She",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 13008
        },
        {
          "text": "When she released me, I returned to the festival before I did something considerably less appropriate in Meme’s kitchen",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 13180
        }
      ],
      "words": 54
    },
    {
      "block": "原句14",
      "no": 14,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I wish Pops could’ve seen it.” Carson’s voice came quieter, and my heart ached because of it. “He would’ve complained,”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15250
        },
        {
          "text": "“He would’ve had an aneurysm over credit cards,” I added, and she laughed again",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15395
        },
        {
          "text": "Carson told me Pops once made a haunted hayride so terrifying that three children cried and Meme banned him from using c",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15723
        },
        {
          "text": "“They weren’t even running.” She wheezed out a laugh at the memory",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15897
        }
      ],
      "words": 78
    },
    {
      "block": "原句15",
      "no": 15,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Apparently, I’d become the kind of man who lay in bed listening to a woman sleep",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16167
        },
        {
          "text": "I could have said it then",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16292
        },
        {
          "text": "Three words into the darkness while Carson slept twenty miles away",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16319
        },
        {
          "text": "Maybe that was exactly why I didn’t",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16436
        },
        {
          "text": "Carson had spent too much of her life having important things happen without getting any say in them",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16472
        },
        {
          "text": "When I told her I loved her, I wanted her awake",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16574
        },
        {
          "text": "More importantly, I wanted her to know there wasn’t a damn thing I expected her to say back",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16658
        }
      ],
      "words": 93
    }
